(*MPF:::===================================================================*
 *
 *  Function Name  : LSMRUQUO_CheckGen
 *  Description    : yields true if the tree allows GLUE + GEN added to it,
                     false otherwise.
                     GLUE + GEN can be added if the last word in the tree  
                     is a NOUN or an INDEFPRO with poss=true
 *  Parameters     : T: LSSTREE_pStree
 *  Result         : 
 *  Precondition   : 
 *  Postcondition  : 
 *  Side Effects   : 
 *
 *EMP:::===================================================================*)

FUNCTION LSMRUQUO_CheckGen(T:LSSTREE_pStree)
                    : BOOLEAN;
EXTERNAL;




